## PR Context

**PR metadata:**
!`gh pr view $0 --json title,body,author,baseRefName,headRefName,additions,deletions,changedFiles,labels,comments,reviewRequests,url 2>/dev/null || echo "ERROR: Could not fetch PR $0. Make sure you passed a valid PR number."`

**Files changed:**
!`gh pr diff $0 --name-only 2>/dev/null`

**Existing review comments (threaded):**
!`gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$0/comments --jq '.[] | if .in_reply_to_id then "  ↳ \(.user.login) replied: \(.body[0:200])" else "\n[\(.path):\(.line // .original_line)] (id:\(.id)) \(.user.login): \(.body[0:200])" end' 2>/dev/null || echo "No inline comments yet"`

**Full diff:**
!`gh pr diff $0 2>/dev/null`

